>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Single-point calculation on the original coordinates and ligand-by-ligand Lewis review. The two-coordinate carbene carbon of the neutral NHC is identifiable. The eight-membered fragment has composition C₈H₈, Both hydrogen-free C–C pairs have strong multiple bonds. Select the coordination limit with neutral cyclooctadiyne, Cl⁻ and Rh(I). Localized 12 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

